    "content" : "I&#39;ve heard of wire-wrapping before and thought that was insane. The way that this guy is wiring surface-mount components is unimaginable. It looks amazing but would have to be a complete headache to get it to work correctly.<br /><a href=\"http://elm-chan.org/docs/wire/wiring_e.html\" class=\"ot-anchor\">http://elm-chan.org/docs/wire/wiring_e.html</a>",
    "objectType" : "note",
    "originalContent" : "I've heard of wire-wrapping before and thought that was insane. The way that this guy is wiring surface-mount components is unimaginable. It looks amazing but would have to be a complete headache to get it to work correctly.\nhttp://elm-chan.org/docs/wire/wiring_e.html",
