        "kind" : "plus#comment",
        "object" : {
          "content" : "I&#39;ve done a few projects on boards with only solder lines on the proto PCBs. I like using wires more except when you find a mistake and the wire is buried below many others.",
          "objectType" : "comment",
          "originalContent" : "I've done a few projects on boards with only solder lines on the proto PCBs. I like using wires more except when you find a mistake and the wire is buried below many others."
        },
