        "kind" : "plus#comment",
        "object" : {
          "content" : "I always had trouble soldering between the circular pads and the solder would just bubble up and not connect the pads. How do you make the pads connect? A lower temperature on the iron would probably help.",
          "objectType" : "comment",
          "originalContent" : "I always had trouble soldering between the circular pads and the solder would just bubble up and not connect the pads. How do you make the pads connect? A lower temperature on the iron would probably help."
        },
